<!-- LINDGREN COMMENTS
  - Note the unique ID hasn't been contextualized
  - I needed to remove all format="ditamap" attributes. THey are in the skeleton, but they are only to be used when the topicref is a .ditamap file.
  - Also, if the titles are the same in the topics, there's no need to use navtitle, so be sure to double check those items across all maps and topicrefs.
  - Be sure to use consistent capitalization across all filenaming. There's still lots of errors to resolve.
-->
